                "text": "More than 33 million Americans, including more than 1.5 million Pennsylvanians, rely on Medicare Advantage as a part of their coverage. Patients, practitioners, and policymakers all agree -- modernization of the prior authorization process is long overdue, and my legislation does just that.\n\nWatch my full exchange during today's @WaysandMeansGOP hearing.\u2b07\ufe0f",
