                "text": "Great to meet with Deb from Erie, a volunteer from the American Cancer Society, during today's @WaysandMeansGOP markup. \n\nDuring our markup, we passed out of Committee the important Nancy Gardner Sewell Medicare Multi-Cancer Early Detection Screening Coverage Act. I\u2019m proud to co-sponsor this critical legislation!",
